  "prefLabel": "Puc 2104.02 Non-Public Information from Non-Affiliated Energy Competitors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2104.02 Non-Public Information from Non-Affiliated Energy Competitors. A utility shall not provide non-public information and data which have been received from non-affiliated energy competitors to its competitive energy affiliates.\n\nSource. #7884-A, eff 5-2-03, EXPIRED: 5-2-11\n\nNew. #9921, eff 5-3-11; ss by #10909, eff 8-8-15; ss by #14556, eff 4-15-26, EXPIRES: 4-15-36 (formerly Puc 2104.03)",
